{"content":{"result":[{"rank_order":1,"title":"setting-up-ec2-instance-profiles","skill_description":"Configures EC2 instances to securely call AWS services by creating and attaching IAM roles via instance profiles, eliminating hardcoded credentials. Use when an EC2 instance needs permissions to access AWS services like S3, DynamoDB, SQS, or CloudWatch through temporary credentials.\n\nServices: ec2, iam\nTasks: configure, secure\nPersona: developer, devops\nWorkload: security\n*","skill_name":"setting-up-ec2-instance-profiles"},{"rank_order":2,"title":"deploying-custom-domain-rest-api","skill_description":"Deploys a Regional REST API with a custom domain name, a Lambda backend function, and a request-based Lambda authorizer using AWS CLI. Covers ACM certificate provisioning, API Gateway REST API creation, Lambda function deployment, request authorizer setup, custom domain configuration, base path mapping, and Route 53 DNS record creation. Trigger keywords: custom domain, REST API, Lambda, Route 53, API Gateway, regional endpoint, request authorizer, base path mapping.\n\n\nServices: api-gateway, lambda, route-53, acm\nTasks: deploy, configure\nPersona: backend-developer\nWorkload: serverless, networking\n*","skill_name":"deploying-custom-domain-rest-api"},{"rank_order":3,"title":"arc-region-switch","skill_description":"Answers questions about Amazon Application Recovery Controller (ARC) Region switch including architecture, plans, execution blocks, workflows, triggers, active/active vs active/passive, cross-account support, recovery time, dashboards, and customer positioning. Applicable when users ask about ARC Region switch adoption, design, or troubleshooting.\n\nServices: arc-region-switch\nTasks: learn, architect, build, debug, migrate, advise\nPersona: developer, devops, solutions-architect\nWorkload: disaster-recovery, multi-region\n*","skill_name":"arc-region-switch"}]}}"}]}], "label": "Verify whether Q Business requires same-region IAM Identity Center linkage", "parent_id": "c99f41d2-8691-4520-b096-b3ce0eb9ae3b"}

